  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- Policy Intent: Leave Policy                                       -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS THE LEAVE POLICY</pattern>
    <template>
      Leave Policy:
      1. Planned Leaves: Submit a leave request at least 24-48 hours in advance through the Requests section in InternOps and inform your mentor/TL.
      2. Sick Leaves: Notify your TL by 10:00 AM on the day of illness.
      3. Exam Leaves: Submit college exam schedules at least 1 week in advance for approval.
      Excess unexcused leaves may affect your completion evaluation.
    </template>
  </category>

