  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <!-- Policy Intent: Workplace Rules & Code of Conduct                  -->
  <!-- ================================================================= -->
  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT ARE THE WORKPLACE RULES</pattern>
    <template>
      Workplace Rules and Code of Conduct:
      1. Professionalism: Maintain respectful and inclusive communication across all platforms.
      2. Data Security: Never share internal company credentials, API keys, student data, or confidential materials outside.
      3. Integrity: Plagiarism or submitting unauthorized work results in immediate termination.
      4. Punctuality: Attend scheduled standups and team meetings on time.
      5. Zero Tolerance: Strict zero-tolerance policy against any form of harassment, discrimination, or misconduct.
    </template>
  </category>

